{"id":8512,"date":"2024-04-22T13:02:34","date_gmt":"2024-04-22T13:02:34","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/?p=8512"},"modified":"2026-08-06T12:57:01","modified_gmt":"2026-08-06T12:57:01","slug":"seo-salary-india","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/seo-salary-india\/","title":{"rendered":"SEO Salary in India in 2026 (For Freshers, Executives, and Managers)"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>Are you all set to start your career as an SEO professional? Then, you certainly want to know the average salary an SEO expert can make in India. Right? This detailed guide will help you understand and evaluate the average SEO salary in India per month for different job roles and positions.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>You will learn about SEO salaries for freshers, analysts, executives, managers, and directors. However, before we discuss the salary packages of SEO professionals, let\u2019s define SEO.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What Is SEO?<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-seo\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Search Engine Optimization (SEO)<\/a> is the heart of digital marketing. It refers to optimizing websites for search engines to boost their ranking and drive traffic.\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Businesses have realized that an appealing website is just the first step of their online journey. They need to make ample efforts to enhance its visibility on search engines and improve brand awareness. Therefore, they hire SEO professionals to optimize their websites. They work on different aspects of SEO, including content, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/on-page-seo\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">on-page<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/off-page-seo\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">off-page<\/a>, web design, social media, etc.\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Also Read: <\/strong><a href