                          <a target=\"_blank\"\n                                   href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/seo-course?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_course_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\"\n                                   class=\"btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm\">\n                                    Learn More\n                                <\/a>\n                            <\/div>\n                        <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                \n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/section>\n\n    \n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>SEO Salary in India in 2026 (Based on Job Roles<\/strong>)<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>With the rise in the popularity of digital marketing, we can see a surge in the demand for SEO professionals. SEO has marked an essential place in the industry, offering diverse and varied job roles. This has also spiked SEO salaries in India, and most job profiles are getting decent packages. We have listed the top SEO jobs with their respective job responsibilities and average salary packages:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>SEO Fresher\/Trainee<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>SEO Trainer<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>SEO Analyst<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>SEO Strategist<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>SEO Consultant<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>SEO Specialist<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>SEO Manager<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>SEO Director<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>1. SEO Fresher\/Trainee<\/strong> <strong>Salary<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>This is the lowest position in the hierarchy of SEO job profiles. SEO trainees or freshers begin from the basics, learning different SEO concepts and approaches and how to apply them. They work under the guidance and supervision of SEO executives, gaining a practical understanding of <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/search-engine-functions\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">how SEO works<\/a>.\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Key Responsibilities<\/strong><\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Track different SEO KPIs and metrics every week or biweekly&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Report analysis and results to SEO managers<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Build quality and relevant links for the website<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Find new ideas to enhance brand visibility on search engines and online platforms<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Conduct keyword research&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Average Salary<\/strong><\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>SEO salary for freshers ranges from INR 18-22k per month, i.e., INR 96,000 \u2013 1,44,000 per year.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>2. SEO Trainer<\/strong> <strong>Salary<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>SEO trainers are experts who mentor and train SEO aspirants. They guide their subordinates, helping them master SEO functioning, its various aspects, and strategies to create compelling content.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>They also train them to assess the performance and progress of SEO campaigns by using cutting-edge tools and techniques. They also teach them about reporting results and controlling actions to get things back on track.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>They require exceptional skills and knowledge to train SEO professionals and prepare them for a promising career.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Key Responsibilities<\/strong><\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Deliver lectures (videos and live)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Train subordinates in SEO techniques<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Design assignments to help teams improve their knowledge<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Address queries and resolve doubts&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Average Salary<\/strong><\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>INR 50-70k, i.e, INR 6,00,000- 8,00,000 per year.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Also Read: <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/lsi-keywords\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">What Are LSI Keywords in SEO? Examples, Benefits, Use<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>3. SEO Analyst<\/strong> <strong>Salary<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>SEO analysts review the work of SEO executives and analyze their performances to ensure results align with desired quality and efficiency. They identify and analyze keywords using various tools and share these keywords with content writers who curate content around them.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>They check that the content is optimized and informative so search engines and users can easily access it. They also improve the quality of landing pages. Their job also includes regular monitoring to enhance a project\u2019s performance.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Their SEO salary per month can vary depending on their job roles. Some SEO analysts are also involved in the competitive analysis and recommend necessary changes in the content for better results.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Key Responsibilities<\/strong><\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Use the right tools for building backlinks, researching keywords, and analyzing competitors.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Design and execute SEO strategies.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Give recommendations regarding content development.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Track SEO metrics to improve projects.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Evaluate competitors and identify gaps to make improvements.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Average Salary<\/strong><\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>INR 20- 27k per month or INR 2,40,000-3,50,000 per year.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>4. SEO Strategist<\/strong> <strong>Salary<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>SEO strategists study SEO techniques, analyzing, reviewing, and implementing required changes for website optimization. They use advanced tools to <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-increase-website-traffic\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">boost website rankings<\/a> on search engines and increase its reach across digital platforms.\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>They combine different SEO tactics and practices to enhance website visibility and change strategies to generate more conversions. They work with analysts and executives, giving suggestions wherever required.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Key Responsibilities<\/strong><\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Optimize content.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Competitor analysis.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Design and execute SEO strategies.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Design link-building strategies.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Report the performance of different SEO campaigns to the SEO manager.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Research relevant keywords to drive conversions and traffic.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Average Salary<\/strong><\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>INR 25-30k per month or INR 3,00,000-3,60,000 per year.<\/p>\n\n\n\n        <div class=\"container position-relative mb-2\">\n            <div class=\"row pb-4\">\n                <h2 style=\"font-size:32px\">Upcoming Masterclass<\/h2>\n                <p>Attend our live classes led by experienced and desiccated instructors of Wscube Tech.<\/p>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"owl-carousel myOwl\">\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/cracking-meta-google-ads-2026-data-automation-attribution?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-07-31T112145_393_1785491880854_775860.webp\" alt=\"Cracking Meta &amp; Google Ads 2026 - Data, Automation &amp; Attribution\" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/ai-engineering-roadmap-2026?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n    