_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-08-05T122121_005_1786351858212_930412.webp\" alt=\"Cybersecurity Professional Career Roadmap 2026\" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>5. SEO Consultant<\/strong> <strong>Salary<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>SEO consultants work as freelancers for a company, offering SEO services whenever needed. They plan, implement, and manage their clients&#8217; SEO strategies, handling multiple tasks and duties, such as content strategizing and planning, website optimization, link building, web marketing, web analytics, etc.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>They can work on several projects simultaneously and have knowledge of <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/best-free-seo-tools\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SEO tools<\/a>. They also provide solutions to challenges faced by companies. They can work for bloggers, corporates, brands, and businesses.\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>They do not need to visit offices regularly but should offer third-party assistance online.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Key Responsibilities<\/strong><\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Plan, develop and implement SEO strategies.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Prepare reports and share them with clients.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Monitor main SEO KPIs and take corrective measures.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Work with web designers and developers to make changes as per SEO.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Average Salary<\/strong><\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>Freelance SEO salary in India is between 30- 50k. They usually charge per project.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Also Read:<\/strong> <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/on-page-seo-checklist\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Full On-Page SEO Checklist (With Strategy)\u00a0<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>6. SEO Specialist<\/strong> <strong>Salary<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>SEO specialists are accountable for managing SEO campaigns and driving organic traffic to web pages. When digital marketing agencies work for clients, SEO specialists handle the projects and find ways to increase website traffic.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>They consider several ranking factors to make changes in the campaign.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Key Responsibilities<\/strong><\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Maintain organic traffic.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Plan and run SEO campaigns.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Find ways to drive traffic to a website.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Make changes to a website according to ranking factors.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Average Salary<\/strong><\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>INR 25- 35k per month or INR 3,50,000-4,50,000 per year.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>7. SEO Manager<\/strong> <strong>Salary<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>SEO managers hold top designations in an organization, overseeing SEO campaigns and programs for clients. Being in a higher position, they have a lot of responsibilities, including analyzing reports of SEO campaigns.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>They work with different marketing teams and members, such as SEO experts, content writers, web designers, PPC experts, etc., to develop and implement data-driven SEO strategies effectively.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The average SEO salary of managers is higher than other job profiles. They guide subordinates and team members regarding keyword research and other aspects of SEO. They also monitor ad campaigns and recommend changes for improvements.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Key Responsibilities<\/strong><\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Analyze the performance of a project and prepare reports.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Manage SEO projects and campaigns.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Optimize landing pages and track KPIs.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Oversee the performance of team members and guide them.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Average Salary<\/strong><\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>INR 30- 45k per month or INR 3,60,000 \u2013 5,40,000 per year.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-white-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-65d330572da20d0556b54e8056241dcd\"><strong>Key SEO Topics You Need to Know<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/seo-skills\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SEO Skills<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/seo-career-path\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SEO Career Path<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/seo-benefits\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SEO Benefits<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/ai-seo-tools\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">AI SEO Tools<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-seo-expert\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Become SEO Expert<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/seo-projects\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SEO Projects<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/seo-interview-questions\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SEO Interview Questions<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-seo-freelancer\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Become SEO Freelancer<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-learn-seo\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">How to Learn SEO?<\/a><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>8. SEO Director<\/strong> <strong>Salary<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>SEO directors are the head of the SEO department, ensuring that the team archives expected results and goals. They plan SEO campaigns, stating objectives, previous shortcomings, targets, and other factors.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>They oversee the entire functioning of the SEO department, assessing every detail and action for the best results. They also evaluate the performance of SEO campaigns and monitor results at the micro level.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>They also set long-term and short-term goals for each team member and motivate them to reach them.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Key Responsibilities<\/strong><\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Design SEO strategies.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Stay updated with the industry trends and news.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Motivate team members to share and implement new ideas.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Ensure that strategies align with the goals.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Review content and identify gaps for improvements.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Collaborate with other teams and stakeholders.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Guide SEO strategists, analysts, and trainees.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Average Salary<\/strong><\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>As seniors in the field, they earn higher than other SEO professionals. The average <strong>senior SEO specialist salary<\/strong> in India is INR 90-95k per month or 12,00,000-16,00,000 per year.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Also Read:<\/strong